[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200400_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200400_03_0010","text":"……哎呀？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200400_03_0020","text":"夏叶……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200400_03_0030","text":"你看，这家店的新年装饰……\n设计好特别，不是吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200400_03_0040","text":"…………\n注连绳上……插着花……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200400_03_0050","text":"是地方特色吗……？\n不过，其他地方确实不太常见呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200400_03_0060","text":"是店里……自己做的吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200400_03_0062","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200400_03_0070","text":"——牡丹和山茶……\n简直……像花束一样……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200400_03_0080","text":"好美……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200400_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200400_03_0090","text":"呐，要不要进这家店看看？\n感觉会摆着很棒的杂货……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200400_03_0100","text":"好……\n进去吧……"}]
